    "Ogni profilo è un account Technogym mywellness. Le password restano cifrate sul NAS; il gateway fa il login e rinnova la sessione da solo. I profili \"famiglia\" sono visibili a tutti gli utenti del gateway.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jedes Profil ist ein Technogym-mywellness-Konto. Passwörter bleiben verschlüsselt auf dem NAS; das Gateway meldet sich an und erneuert die Sitzung selbst. „Familien“-Profile sehen alle Gateway-Nutzer."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each profile is a Technogym mywellness account. Passwords stay encrypted on the NAS; the gateway logs in and renews the session on its own. \"Family\" profiles are visible to every gateway user."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada perfil es una cuenta Technogym mywellness. Las contraseñas quedan cifradas en el NAS; el gateway inicia sesión y la renueva solo. Los perfiles \"familia\" son visibles para todos los usuarios del gateway."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque profil est un compte Technogym mywellness. Les mots de passe restent chiffrés sur le NAS ; le gateway se connecte et renouvelle la session seul. Les profils « famille » sont visibles par tous les utilisateurs du gateway."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ogni settimana (stesso giorno e ora)": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jede Woche (gleicher Tag und Uhrzeit)"
